 &lt;br /&gt; 
6. The Company mainly operates in a single primary business segment of Speciality Chemicals, therefore disclosure requirements as per Ind AS 108, "Operating Segments" are not applicable to the Company. &lt;br /&gt; 
 &lt;br /&gt; 
